('advanced-native-1159', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1159-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["A demanding learning process with useful smaller gains and unresolved parts."],"options":["The archive notes had replaced the need to look at the handwriting.","A demanding learning process with useful smaller gains and unresolved parts.","The main difficulty was finding where the letters were stored, rather than learning to read their handwriting.","The complete letters had become easy as soon as one name was recognised."]},"advanced-native-1159-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I made smaller gains but still had to work carefully on whole sentences.","Some pages remained hard despite recognising individual names.","It felt like climbing a mountain because understanding came through several demanding stages.","The comparison captures the effort between the first recognisable details and a fuller reading."],"options":["I made smaller gains but still had to work carefully on whole sentences.","Some pages remained hard despite recognising individual names.","It felt like climbing a mountain because understanding came through several demanding stages.","The comparison captures the effort between the first recognisable details and a fuller reading."]},"advanced-native-1159-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Climbing a mountain is literal in this passage; a broader goal metaphor would need more context."],"options":["The passage establishes that the walker is studying handwritten letters rather than travelling.","The words describe how quickly a simple task was finished, not an ascent.","Climbing a mountain is literal in this passage; a broader goal metaphor would need more context."]},"advanced-native-1159-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The learner is guaranteed to finish if they never take a break."],"options":["The speaker can explain which smaller steps helped.","Learning felt demanding and extended.","The learner is guaranteed to finish if they never take